        "date": "2026-11-23T18:36:13Z"
      },
      "message": "feat(machines): add the Ooznest WorkBee 1000x1500 (Estlcam) machine\n\nA library machine from Ooznest's public 1000x1500 product page:\n770 x 1270 x 88 mm travel and 2500 mm/min X/Y feed and rapid. Z rates\nand the rpm range stay unstated. No post is named: Estlcam's control\nrules (each line needs its G word, I/J arcs only, no full circles) are\nnot confirmed for any built-in post; #3735 tracks that post. The owner\nmust confirm the work area.\n\nFixes #3038\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
