      "message": "fix(machines): WorkBee travel takes the smaller value on each axis\n\nX 1200 (the WorkBee owner's figure, inside the published 1270), Y 770\n(the published figure; the owner's 800 is more), Z 88 (published).\nMaintainer decision on PR #3736. The owner must still confirm his frame\nand travel.\n\nRefs #3038\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
